
h1 Usage and billing API

h2 Use Billing in the Console

h2 Monthly auto-topup
Route | Body | Result
GET /v1/organizations/{organization_id}/billing/auto-topup | None | Amount, status, payment link, and period dates.
POST /v1/organizations/{organization_id}/billing/auto-topup/checkout | Optional amount_usd; default 10. Optional workspace_id and selected_gb preserve a storage selection. | checkout_url and status.
POST /v1/organizations/{organization_id}/billing/auto-topup/amount | Required amount_usd. | Updated summary; amount applies to the next refill.
POST /v1/organizations/{organization_id}/billing/auto-topup/cancel | Empty object. | Summary with cancellation scheduled.
POST /v1/organizations/{organization_id}/billing/auto-topup/resume | Empty object. | Summary with the scheduled cancellation reversed.

h2 Storage changes

h2 GET /v1/organizations/{organization_id}/billing
Name | Location | Value | Required
organization_id | path | string | Yes
Field | Type | Present | Constraints
organization_id | string | Yes | uuid
status | string | Yes | 
selected_gb | integer | Yes | 
pending_gb | integer or null | Yes | 
period_start | string | Yes | date-time
period_end | string | Yes | date-time
search_limit_usd | string | Yes | Organization search spending cap. 9223372036854.775807 means no cap is set.
allowance_usd | string | Yes | 
storage_allowance | object | Yes | Storage capacity and usage.
storage_allowance.effective_storage_bytes | string | Yes | Decimal byte count.
storage_allowance.used_storage_bytes | string | Yes | Decimal byte count.
storage_allowance.reserved_storage_bytes | string | Yes | Decimal byte count.

h2 Search spending caps

h2 POST /v1/organizations/{organization_id}/billing/limits
Name | Location | Value | Required
organization_id | path | string | Yes
Idempotency-Key | header | string | Yes
Field | Type | Presence | Guidance
maximum_usd | string | Required | Search spending cap in USD for the selected organization, workspace, or key scope. Use 1 to 12 digits, a period, and exactly six decimal places, such as "25.000000". Values such as "25" or "25.00" return 400 invalid_billing_amount.
workspace_id | string | Optional | uuid
key_id | string | Optional | uuid
Field | Type | Present | Constraints
maximum_usd | string | Yes | 
workspace_id | string or null | Yes | 
key_id | string or null | Yes | 

h2 GET /v1/organizations/{organization_id}/billing/limits
Name | Location | Value | Required
organization_id | path | string | Yes

h2 GET /v1/organizations/{organization_id}/billing/usage
Name | Location | Value | Required
organization_id | path | string | Yes
Field | Type | Present | Constraints
storage | object or null | Yes | 
storage_allowance | object | Yes | Storage capacity and usage.
storage_allowance.effective_storage_bytes | string | Yes | Decimal byte count.
storage_allowance.used_storage_bytes | string | Yes | Decimal byte count.
storage_allowance.reserved_storage_bytes | string | Yes | Decimal byte count.
search | object | Yes | 
search.settled_usd | string | Yes | Charges settled during this period.
search.reserved_usd | string | Yes | Holds for in-progress requests started in this period.
search.period_start | string | Yes | Inclusive UTC date-time.
search.period_end | string | Yes | Exclusive UTC date-time.
search.period_source | subscription, calendar_month | Yes | Auto-topup billing period, or UTC calendar month.
search.period_current | boolean | Yes | Whether the period contains the current time.

