Name | Location | Value | Required
organization_id | path | string | Yes
Field | Type | Present | Constraints
currency | "usd" | Yes | 
balance_usd | string | Yes | 
reserved_usd | string | Yes | 
available_usd | string | Yes | 
purchased_credits_usd | string | Yes | 
subscription_credits_usd | string | Yes | Total subscription-sourced credits.
auto_topup_credits_usd | string | Yes | Auto-topup credits available until used.
expiring_subscription_credits_usd | string | Yes | Remaining credits from earlier expiring plans.
promotional_credits_usd | string | Yes | Available promotional credits.
promotional_grants | array of object | Yes | Original grant amounts, descriptions, creation dates, and expiry dates.
storage_allowance | object | Yes | Storage capacity and usage.
storage_allowance.effective_storage_bytes | string | Yes | Decimal byte count.
storage_allowance.used_storage_bytes | string | Yes | Decimal byte count.
storage_allowance.reserved_storage_bytes | string | Yes | Decimal byte count.
subscription_credits_expire_at | string or null | Yes | date-time
status | string | Yes | 

h2 GET /v1/organizations/{organization_id}/billing/activity
Query parameter | Meaning
limit | Number of entries, 1–100; default 50.
cursor | Use the previous response’s next_cursor unchanged.
activity_type | Optional: promotional, purchase, subscription, storage, search, refund, dispute, or expiration.
Field | Meaning
id | Activity identifier.
type | Activity type; subscription includes monthly credit refills.
description | Human-readable description.
amount_usd | Signed six-place USD decimal string. Positive amounts add credit; negative amounts reduce it.
occurred_at | Transaction time, or UTC day start for consolidated search entries.
search_count | Search count as a string, or null for other entries.
ongoing | Whether the daily search entry is still accumulating activity.

h2 POST /v1/organizations/{organization_id}/billing/purchases
Name | Location | Value | Required
organization_id | path | string | Yes
Idempotency-Key | header | string | Yes
Field | Type | Presence | Guidance
amount_usd | integer | Required | Minimum: 5. Maximum: 500. Multiples of 5
Field | Type | Present | Constraints
id | string | Yes | 
state | string | Yes | 
checkout_url | string | Yes | uri

h2 GET /v1/organizations/{organization_id}/billing/purchases/{purchase_id}
Name | Location | Value | Required
organization_id | path | string | Yes
purchase_id | path | string | Yes
Field | Type | Present | Constraints
id | string | Yes | 
state | pending, paid, expired, failed | Yes | 
amount_usd | integer | Yes | 

h2 GET /v1/organizations/{organization_id}/billing/invoices
Name | Location | Value | Required
organization_id | path | string | Yes
limit | query | integer, 1–100; default 50 | Optional
cursor | query | The previous response’s next_cursor, unchanged | Optional
Field | Type | Present | Constraints
data | array of object | Yes | 
data[].id | string | Yes | Invoice identifier.
data[].number | string or null | Yes | Invoice number.
data[].issued_at | string or null | Yes | date-time
data[].description | string or null | Yes | 
data[].currency | string | Yes | Lowercase currency code, such as usd.
data[].total_cents | string | Yes | Invoice total in cents, as a decimal string.
data[].status | string | Yes | Invoice status, such as paid or open.
data[].hosted_url | string or null | Yes | uri. Page for viewing or paying the invoice.
data[].pdf_url | string or null | Yes | uri. PDF download link.
next_cursor | string or null | Yes | 

