h2 POST /v1/workspaces/{workspace_id}/storage/quote
Name | Location | Value | Required
workspace_id | path | string | Yes
Field | Type | Presence | Guidance
selected_gb | integer | Required | 0 for free storage, or a whole GB within the returned policy bounds (currently 5–100).
Field | Type | Present | Constraints
id | string | Yes | uuid
selected_gb | integer | Yes | 
action | start, upgrade, schedule, keep, restore, free | Yes | 
charge_usd | string | Yes | 
monthly_usd | string | Yes | 
